  "reasoning": "This commit (\"Grid image issue resolved\") removed the direct `gridview.setAdapter(imageAdapter);` call that previously existed right after `findViewById(R.id.gridView)`, moving the adapter-setting logic into a `runOnUiThread` block inside the async network response callback instead. This meant that when `updateUI()` did not trigger a network fetch (e.g., movies list was already populated), the GridView's adapter was never set, causing the grid to display nothing. The fix commit restores the `gridview.setAdapter(imageAdapter);` call immediately after `findViewById`, directly undoing the omission introduced by this commit.",
